LISA atomic_read_of_a_plain_write
(* One place with a plain write and atomic accesses. A sequentially consistent read of `x` that
   reads the plain write does not synchronize with it, so the two race (C7). Program.drf_sc in
   the Lean model covers such a race.
   Expect: sometimes, a data race. *)
{ x = 0; }
 P0                  | P1                   ;
 w[plain] x 1        | r[sc] r0 x           ;
 w[sc] x 2           |                      ;
scopes: (system P0 P1)
exists (1:r0 = 1)
